   "lines": [
    "Van Renselaer & I",
    "drove over to take tea",
    "at the Saltonstalls. We",
    "went out walking with",
    "Rose and Alice in the",
    "afternoon, and got",
    "drenched in a rain",
    "storm; driving home",
    "it was pitch dark,",
    "and I came within",
    "an ace of smashing up",
    "against a wagon."
   ],
